! This test calculates the non-relativistic DFT energy with the B3LYP functional
! Note that we consistently leave out the SS integrals.
!
! The test is meant to check the automatic detection of symmetry and the use of NR basis sets
! We assume that the correlation consistent basis sets are available in your standard path. These sets can be
! obtained from the DALTON distribution and may later be included in the DIRAC distribution as well.
